      "content": "The thought of becoming a hollow shell is a terrifying prospect, and it makes perfect sense that you're scared of that loss. If you are feeling like the only way to stop the feeling is to end things, please know that there are people who want to support you through this overwhelming pain right now. You can connect with compassionate listeners immediately by calling or texting 988 in the US and Canada.",
      "source": "target",
